routine at the record build's compiled traadv_fct.f90:167-176. That routine
writes first u/v/w faces at :503-533, the first divergence and midpoint at
:536-549, averaged faces at :572-608, and the final divergence plus divided
Krhs at :611-623. The stage constructs metric-bearing horizontal and vertical
transports at compiled stprk3_stg.f90:295-296 and :326-346 and passes them to
tracer advection at :860. The candidate preserves these materialization and
association boundaries and carries the already-divided concentration RHS into
the stage-3 content update.

LOCAL PROOF. With NEMO's recorded kt2-stage3 entry and all recorded operands,
the pre-edit production-JIT walk first differs at the horizontal first-upwind
faces: T first-u 5,958 cells / 2.3283064365386963e-10 and S first-u 5,947 /
2.3283064365386963e-10. All ten candidate source rows for both T and S are BIT
in production-step JIT, production eager, and isolated-closure JIT. The
production-JIT one-ULP p_u plant changes the exact source row and exits
nonzero. The dry-cell representation needs an inert divisor because legoESM
stores zero dry thickness where NEMO retains finite reference e3t before
masking; the added regression fails without that guard.

